 table's SHAPE (same grid sizes and second counts, matched by grid shape) — the PLACES, names, moods, links and entities are Western Heart canon, never LSD's. Navigation flags 0-12 and 14-29 are assigned across arrival points; flag 13 is deliberately unassigned — the decomp notes goal 13 is in neither link list and can never be completed, and WH keeps that quirk honestly.","sources":["klnuno/lsd-decomp docs/engine/stages-and-places.md (grids, lengths, chunk/tile geometry)","klnuno/lsd-decomp docs/engine/links.md (link table format)","klnuno/lsd-decomp docs/engine/dream-system.md (moods, graph, scores)"],"version":1},"scriptedWalks":[{"desc":"two turns, forward steps","id":0,"ticksRunning":19,"ticksWalking":133},{"desc":"three turns the other way, looks down, forward steps","id":1,"ticksRunning":25,"ticksWalking":149},{"desc":"one turn, forward steps","id":2,"ticksRunning":15,"ticksWalking":101},{"desc":"two turns, looks down, forward steps","id":3,"ticksRunning":19,"ticksWalking":113}],"specialDays":{"100":{"text":"One hundred dreams. The head-world has kept count even when you did not. Tonight the graph itself is the dream — a hundred points, and you are the line between them.","title":"The Hundredth Dream","type":"text"},"126":{"text":"The calendar lists this day twice, and the Dreaming obeys the calendar. You dream it once; the second copy waits, patient, for a dreamer who never comes.","title":"Twin Day","type":"text"},"200":{"text":"Two hundred days of dreaming, and the night has grown long enough to hold a second sleeper. Somewhere in the dark, another soul is dreaming your dream back at you.","title":"The Long Night","type":"text"},"365":{"text":"A year of dreams, complete. The Palace of Dreaming dims its pools, the Trader shutters his stall, and the graph is full. Sleep once more, and the year begins again.","title":"Year's End — the Dreaming Closes","type":"text"},"40":{"text":"Forty days. The Trader closes his ledger for one night and reads your balance ba